Mana bisa ngeladenin dua orang sekaligus.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:55.200
Iya, pindah sana lagi.

00:12:57.433 --> 00:12:57.866
Mm.

00:12:58.300 --> 00:12:59.300
Mm.

